      "message": "I\u0027ll give this a try, but my suspicion is that we get into build system trouble land again then. `Rust::Slice\u003c\u003e` we might get, but I am not sure we easily get `fontations_ffi::ColorStop` in there - see above, I previously cleaned that up to make the interface pure virtual.",
